doc2wiki Python POC, created September 21, 2026.

This new Python implementation recreates and simplifies the PDF ingestion
workflow of LLM Wiki by Yong Su:
https://github.com/nashsu/llm_wiki
Reference commit: e8082119649e6a8e1cf85eaf289adcabfdf39d4e

Upstream attribution: LLM Wiki - Copyright (C) 2024-2026 Yong Su.
The reference project is distributed under GNU GPL version 3.
This recreation is distributed under GNU GPL version 3; see LICENSE.

The original desktop UI, query, retrieval, research, embedding and interactive
review-action systems are not included. Ingestion prompts, purpose/schema
templates, long-source processing, page merges, and review suggestions are
adapted in Python for a readable PDF-only proof of concept. Review items are
written as Markdown and offline HTML rather than handled in an application.
